    {
      "id": "TGwATWHk6wHQD914ckHJZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 740.8564778477696,
      "y": 5428.907554747722,
      "width": 1243,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b41",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 599724918,
      "version": 22,
      "versionNonce": 543463082,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785506932409,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Today's session is one of my favorite topics because Docker, Kubernetes, Gunicorn, Celery, PostgreSQL—everything \ndepends on these Linux concepts.\n\nToday we'll answer questions like:\n\nWhy does kill -9 always work?\nWhat is a Zombie Process?\nWhy does Docker stop when PID 1 exits?\nWhy doesn't Linux kill processes immediately?\nWhat is fork()?\nWhat is exec()?\n\nDay 3 Part 2 Roadmap\n\n| Time   | Topic                       |\n| ------ | --------------------------- |\n| 15 min | Process States              |\n| 20 min | fork() & exec()             |\n| 15 min | Signals                     |\n| 10 min | Real-world Backend Examples |\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Today's session is one of my favorite topics because Docker, Kubernetes, Gunicorn, Celery, PostgreSQL—everything \ndepends on these Linux concepts.\n\nToday we'll answer questions like:\n\nWhy does kill -9 always work?\nWhat is a Zombie Process?\nWhy does Docker stop when PID 1 exits?\nWhy doesn't Linux kill processes immediately?\nWhat is fork()?\nWhat is exec()?\n\nDay 3 Part 2 Roadmap\n\n| Time   | Topic                       |\n| ------ | --------------------------- |\n| 15 min | Process States              |\n| 20 min | fork() & exec()             |\n| 15 min | Signals                     |\n| 10 min | Real-world Backend Examples |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Mow3e4WDfM1lfxpYulMbd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 737.5711160056646,
      "y": 6021.53913369509,
      "width": 253,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b42",
